WEBVTT

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.360
Good night, my darlings. Have a nice dream.

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:40.280
Mrs. Sherrywood, will Mr. Sherrywood come and see us?

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:43.130
Oh yes, he won't be long. Don't worry.

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:45.300
I hope you don't arrive too late.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.300
He's complaining about you.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.150
Mr. Sherrywood!

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:53.150
Look, I'm the king of jugglers.

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:55.150
Watch out, here we go.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.960
One, and two, and three, and that's it.

00:00:58.960 --> 00:00:59.960
Thank you.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.090
And you, and you, and... and you!

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:09.090
And now, we have to sleep and dream of clowns and circuses, acrobats, jugglers...

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:13.300
And don't forget, you'll have to tell me everything tomorrow morning.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:16.250
History, Mr. Cherrywood, history!

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:18.250
Oh yes, the circus one, please!

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:20.250
Oh yes, please!

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:22.250
Yes, yes, history!

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:25.850
All right, just one story.

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:26.970
Ah!

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:53.630
It's the story of a little girl and a little boy named Amy and Jeannot, who met very strange and very very nice friends.

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:57.270
It was the teddy bears, you see?

00:01:57.270 --> 00:02:00.000
The teddy bears have a special mission.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:05.170
This mission is to help people to be happy and to get along with each other.

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:11.190
The Bisonours live in a magical place called the Bison's Garden.

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:23.300
Bisonours, you're my friend when I'm in trouble.

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:27.970
Bisonours, you show me the way.

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:36.960
The garden above the clouds

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:44.860
The crazy garden for the wise children

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:49.710
Sweet kiss, give me your rainbow

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:53.010
To cheer and slide

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:55.960
It's the race at the sleigh wheel

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:05.000
Day by day

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:07.630
Kiss the bear, open your big garden to my heart

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:12.490
Kiss the bear, show me your beautiful drawings

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:16.060
I like the images

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:19.880
Kiss the bear, you're my best scarecrow

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:09.610
Big secret, it's not the autumn cloud that made a mess, it's your fault!

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:16.900
Hi, I'm Big Friend, and he's Big Secret, and we're teddy bears!

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:18.300
What do you want?

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.220
To become your friends!

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:24.640
I have to tell you that Amy and Jeannot were both very cute and very wise,

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:30.000
but they had so much grief when their parents left that they decided that they would never like each other again.

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:33.160
to not have to suffer in the event that he would have to go as well.

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:36.380
Emy and his little brother thought that they needed someone.

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:38.480
But the teddy bears didn't believe a word of it.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:42.730
You need friends, Jeannot. Even Emy and you.

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:44.790
No, we're not your friends.

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.580
Here, do you know what we're called?

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:48.860
Oh, we know a lot about you two.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:52.560
Emy reads a lot of books and she wants to be a nurse when she grows up.

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:55.370
And you, Jeannot, you want to be a jet pilot.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:57.370
Oh, yes? Who told you that?

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:00.000
When you have a real friend, he knows all your secrets by heart.

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:01.900
...with all your hopes and dreams...

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:08.400
Big secret said, don't be afraid, no one has kept a secret as well as Big Secret.

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:11.600
I'm going to tell you the lesson we've learned about people we love.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.570
They always let you down.

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:16.580
Yeah, so we'd rather not have any friends at all.

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:24.190
Leave us alone!

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:30.000
While the Big Big Bees tried their best to convince Amy and Juno, Big Big Bees were enraptured.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:35.360
to help a little boy, who had only one wish in the world, make friends.

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:45.310
Nicolas was the assistant of a magician, but he had never had a friend in his whole life.

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:05.890
Nyaaah! There we're bored!

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:21.920
I didn't do it on purpose.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.900
Aha! It's never on purpose!

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:28.900
Nicolas, it was bad, I bought it only because I was told that it contained accessories for presentation.

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:30.000
Everything must be careful!

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:39.050
But what am I going to be able to do with you every time I give you the smallest thing to do and it goes boom here and crack there?

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:40.870
I'm sorry Mr. Fettuccine.

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:42.830
I don't want any more excuses.

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:48.070
Look if this mall doesn't have new accessories to do prestidigitation.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:51.070
So come jump to introduce me.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:08:00.000
Very well, one day I will teach you how to do it.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.520
to amuse and conquer the crowds,

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:05.640
but for a quarter of an hour, you don't need a nail.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:36.560
I would like to find friends, people who love me so much, I would give anything.

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:42.280
Anything?

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:45.220
Nicolas.

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:51.790
Is there someone? Who said that?

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:56.450
You said "anything" right?

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:10.150
"Big Kiss was trapped. He wanted to call the teddy bears to help, but unfortunately they were all busy making their new invention."

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:16.510
"With this invention, we can send teddy bear teams around the world in a matter of seconds."

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:20.720
"To bring them back home if they have little troubles."

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:24.730
"With that, we can go faster to help all the little children."

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:30.000
"Wait for the machine to be ready. And as long as we haven't tried it, I don't know what to do."

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:32.300
I don't know if it's going to work at all.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:36.300
Why do I always have to fix everything that's stuck here?

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:40.300
Because you're a true mechanic, and you never mess around, Grognon!

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:46.050
I understand why the first one failed.

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:52.440
There! It's this threading star that got stuck in the ropes.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:55.330
Since it's a threading star, then let it go.

00:09:55.330 --> 00:10:00.000
Has anyone seen Little Cockatoo and Little Cockatoo?

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.920
They've disappeared!

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.960
We're going to find them, Big Man Ours!

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:06.820
We'll try the rescue capsule later!

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:11.270
This bunch of little roaches is probably doing stupid things!

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:21.360
And what's this little roach thing?

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:24.500
It's not a little roach thing, it's a...

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:27.590
Uh... a racoon!

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:29.410
Very good!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:32.440
Razoodidoo, what is that?

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:34.730
Uh, that's, uh...

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:37.670
soap bubbles.

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.910
Square soap bubbles.

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.900
Square bubbles?

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:45.590
Oh my, what a pretty square bubble!

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:47.580
Do you want...

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.610
a special color?

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:56.850
Where are those square bubbles?

00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:58.960
There aren't even any circles!

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:02.940
The crown, Little Cockatoo?

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:05.800
Little Cockatoo, what stupidity have you done again?

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:08.000
It's not a stupidity, Grognon, look!

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:11.710
They managed to repair the space-saving capsule.

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:15.960
But we still don't know if we can travel in there or not.

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:21.760
Oh, look!

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:24.680
It's a miracle! Here are the visitors!

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:26.390
What are they doing here?

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:30.000
Oh, we didn't bring them. They arrived on their own.

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:32.190
They weren't with us in the autumn clouds.

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:33.680
I was sure of it!

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:36.270
It's the little kids who did something stupid!

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:39.830
Sir, what are we going to do with these two children?

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:40.830
I don't know!

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:42.830
This kind of problem has never happened!

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:45.330
But if they are nice, we could keep them with us!

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:48.160
Hey! We also have our word to say!

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:49.840
Where are we here?

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:52.540
Oh yes! Please excuse me!

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:54.040
One, two, three!

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:57.040
Hello! We are the Lululux!

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:59.410
No! We don't want any friends!

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:01.890
To the Poseidon Garden.

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:04.360
Come, we're going to show you around.

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:07.910
Okay, but I'm sure we're going to hate you.

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:16.720
I know that you and that this huge world is not made for you.

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:20.900
But if you hide when you're unhappy,

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:24.690
no one can help you so that it gets better.

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:30.000
I know you don't want to have any more friends, because you have none.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.920
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:07.080
To have fun!

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:34.160
A bunch of friends, it's so nice

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:37.980
Playing with friends, it's funny

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:42.670
And holding their hands, it's so hot

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:48.000
Let's all go, to stay in the race

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:51.170
We have to call the rescue

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:53.570
The rescue

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:54.570
All the friends

00:13:54.570 --> 00:13:55.680
Zounou

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:59.100
We have to call the rescue

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:03.410
♪ All the friends, all of us. ♪

00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:09.800
And so, thanks to the teddy bears,

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:12.960
Amy and Jeannot found the happiness of having real friends.

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:15.620
For them, everything was going well.

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:22.160
But for Nicholas, things were starting to go very, very badly.

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:26.560
Nicholas...

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:30.000
Nicholas...

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:39.130
Who are you? Do you know what my name is?

00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:43.180
I am a spirit, Nicholas. I am your friend.

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:48.600
I know a lot of secrets. Almost all the secrets.

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:49.560
All the secrets?

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:52.690
For example, I know the secret to making friends.

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:54.800
Is that true? Tell us.

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:57.440
Thanks to magic.

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:59.170
Magic?

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:00.000
Oh, don't talk nonsense!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:05.720
of Fettuccine, I mean the real magic, a magic power thanks to which I can

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:12.920
exalt all your desires. So tell me, your magic could bring me friends?

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:21.260
Much better, you will have this power, it's very easy, you just have to open the lock.

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:25.260
Oh no!

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:38.390
- What are you doing here? - I have to stop him.

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:52.210
- Nicolas! - Nicky!

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:58.040
- Are you alright? You're quiet. - Read this.

00:15:58.040 --> 00:16:00.000
Heart, deaf...

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:02.980
I did that?

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:03.480
Yes.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.480
And you have other powers.

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:08.810
Mickey, open the door, it's locked!

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:09.630
Lee!

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:11.130
Lee!

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:13.920
Ishika Biblu.

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:16.360
Hey, Nicholas!

00:16:16.360 --> 00:16:19.060
Go on, open the door.

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:26.460
Hey, it works!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.260
Your magic worked?

00:16:28.260 --> 00:16:30.000
Well done, Nicholas.

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:35.860
And your master will sleep on his feet for as long as you need to steal his magicians' gifts.

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:39.010
But... I... I can't do that.

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:41.200
Of course you can! You must!

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:45.730
It's a dream come true to show that you're a better magician than he is.

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:50.890
It's thanks to his magicians' talent that we love him, and you too will love him for your talent.

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:52.980
You must believe me.

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:56.850
Tala, don't listen to him. You'll never make friends like this.

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:58.290
Who are you?

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:00.000
Groby, I'm a black beast.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.740
for his mission: a friend.

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:03.320
A friend? Him?

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:06.440
Where was he when you needed him, huh?

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:09.270
The most important thing is that I'm here now,

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:11.980
when Nicholas doesn't need my help anymore.

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:19.180
Nicholas, if you possess the art of magic,

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:21.390
you can do anything you want.

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:22.630
Oh yeah? Extra?

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:24.970
No, Nicholas, magic won't help you in any way.

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:28.250
It's the sincerity of your feelings that will bring you friends.

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:30.000
Don't listen to him. There are

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:37.190
There are no children waiting there. Under the chapiteau, they would like to see your magic tricks.

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:40.190
They will finally love me as much as the great Fettuccine.

00:17:40.190 --> 00:17:45.260
I know all his tricks, and I'm not doing anything wrong.

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:49.430
It won't work. This wicked witch is making fun of him.

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:51.540
Oh, no, no...

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:55.600
What the fuck?

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:12.420
And now, the extraordinary Nicholas is going to take out a turtleneck of his best shape.

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:30.000
Watch out!

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.910
I'm sure it would end like this.

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:33.910
Make them stop, madam!

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:35.210
Why are they making fun of me?

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:37.210
You alone can make them quiet!

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:41.710
Here, give them a good lesson!

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:42.710
Huh? Lesson?

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:45.790
Come on, go ahead! Make them laugh!

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:49.780
Yes, a lesson that they will never forget!

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:55.890
Zimazag!

00:18:55.890 --> 00:18:57.000
Zidid!

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:58.000
Kolono!

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:00.000
Asnogli!

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:14.220
They will suffer as much as you have suffered all your life not to have a friend in the world.

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:17.130
Their hearts will dry out.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:21.110
Nicolas! What have you done?

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:24.620
I have done what they have done to me. They deserve it.

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:27.760
No, Nicolas, I won't listen to you anymore!

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:28.800
Quickly, Nicolas!

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:40.530
- F*ck! - I'm going to make a mission for the big jewelry!

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:08.780
Grottaca is still stuck in his head!

00:20:08.780 --> 00:20:18.560
What are you looking for?

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:21.160
Oh, excuse me, Grognon, but I have to go.

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:23.360
I have extra news for Emy and Jeannot!

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:26.820
- I have a wonderful idea! - Watch out!

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:28.610
Take care of the little ones!

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:43.310
Balabrie is coming!

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:45.360
Get ready my friends!

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:47.190
He's coming!

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:05.860
Did you get anything for the gift?

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:09.380
I think it's fine.

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:13.690
We can't say that much about the jewelry garden. Look!

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:15.990
Oh no!

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:18.250
Everything's in ruins!

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.080
Everything's collapsed!

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:21.080
In ruins!

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:23.080
Big, big kiss! Big kiss!

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:27.140
The master jewelry has fallen by two big points!

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:34.200
If the needle goes down like that, it means that people don't like each other on Earth anymore.

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:36.650
Yes, but what could that mean?

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:39.270
It's the same reason that triggered the hurricane.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:44.530
A little boy named Nicholas got bitten by an evil sorceress.

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:46.530
An evil sorceress?

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:49.770
And what happens when the meter falls to zero?

00:21:49.770 --> 00:21:53.080
Well, all the inhabitants of Earth stop loving each other.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:22:00.000
Oh!

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.460
Oh, would that be the end of the garden of kisses?

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:06.360
I think that's exactly what the evil witch dreams of doing.

00:22:06.360 --> 00:22:13.110
Oh, oh my God, I forgot, I found you very nice parents at the orphanage, they want to adopt you both.

00:22:13.110 --> 00:22:15.690
But congratulations, Amy and Jeannot.

00:22:15.690 --> 00:22:20.630
Grignion, come quickly, we have to prepare the rescue capsule to bring Amy and Jeannot there.

00:22:20.630 --> 00:22:21.830
Come on, hurry up.

00:22:21.830 --> 00:22:25.590
Do you hear, Jeannot, your parents?

00:22:25.590 --> 00:22:30.000
Yes, I thought we would never have parents.

00:22:35.020 --> 00:22:38.420
Jeannot, our friends are in the barn.

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:43.400
Amy, Jeannot, it's ready, come!

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:46.540
Let's go!

00:22:46.540 --> 00:22:48.930
No matter what, let's go to the orphanage.

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:51.090
I'm sure you need us.

00:22:51.090 --> 00:22:51.860
Yes!

00:22:51.860 --> 00:22:55.690
But there are parents who are waiting for you.

00:22:55.690 --> 00:22:57.930
Our decision is made.

00:22:57.930 --> 00:23:00.000
You taught us that it was friendship

00:23:00.320 --> 00:23:02.320
When we have friends, we have to help them!

00:23:02.320 --> 00:23:03.200
Oh yes?

00:23:03.200 --> 00:23:04.260
Yes, that's right!

00:23:04.260 --> 00:23:05.260
Yes!

00:23:05.260 --> 00:23:07.490
Yes!

00:23:07.490 --> 00:23:08.490
Very good!

